# Manually authored observation pack, not an inferred physical law.
@input input
@source text
Alice is at the lab. The book is at the lab.
@person data.fact name "at" arg0 "Alice" arg1 "lab"
@object data.fact name "at" arg0 "book" arg1 "lab"
@facts data.sequence arg0 $person arg1 $object
@output data.record facts $facts source $source status "authored-observation"
